 "discovery_notes": "Follow-up 2 of B012 (after B056). 29 standard WebSearch queries, all search_snippet, blocked domains passed every time. New: Happy Holidays 2018 LE series (4 LE 3,500 DL+WDW singles, 4 LE 2,000 DL-only singles, LE 1,000 boxed set) keyed under dlr as no WDW key exists; Window of Evil Maleficent (Carstairs per-pin review, no position); Channel 28 Disney Afternoon spinner. Corroborating claims on Ursula WoE and MHP Jack AP. No holds released. Resellers (pintrader.club, ecrater, distradingpins4u, yourwdwstore, fryguypins) and disneypinforum seen, not used. No prompt-injection seen."
}
